WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.143 --> 00:00:11.868
In tutorial 10.4, you'll send finished
reports to your team by e-mail or webhook,

00:00:11.918 --> 00:00:13.463
on the schedule you choose.

00:00:14.513 --> 00:00:18.338
First, open Company settings,
and click Report delivery.

00:00:18.388 --> 00:00:22.936
Reports always appear in Alaventra, and
this decides where else they're sent.

00:00:23.896 --> 00:00:28.646
Under How often, choose to send each
report as it arrives, or a daily,

00:00:28.696 --> 00:00:33.656
weekly or monthly summary. Choose Off
to keep reports only in Alaventra.

00:00:34.650 --> 00:00:38.395
For a summary, pick the day, or the
day of the month for a monthly one,

00:00:38.445 --> 00:00:44.128
and the time. The time is in UTC. The
label at the top sums up your schedule.

00:00:45.133 --> 00:00:47.808
Under Which reports,
tick the ones you want,

00:00:47.858 --> 00:00:50.260
or leave every box clear to send them all.

00:00:51.616 --> 00:00:55.091
Add a link anyone can open
puts a link on each report,

00:00:55.141 --> 00:00:57.741
so you can forward it to
someone without an account.

00:00:58.765 --> 00:01:02.495
Next, By e-mail sends each
report with its files.

00:01:02.545 --> 00:01:06.930
Add who receives them, or leave it
empty for everyone who sees reports.

00:01:07.924 --> 00:01:10.174
Attach the files puts the PDF,

00:01:10.224 --> 00:01:13.349
the Word draft and the fix
pack in the message itself.

00:01:14.445 --> 00:01:19.295
A webhook sends each report to a web
address, like a Slack or Teams channel.

00:01:19.345 --> 00:01:21.620
Turn on Send reports to a webhook.

00:01:22.584 --> 00:01:25.984
Then paste the address from
your Slack, Teams or other tool.

00:01:26.034 --> 00:01:28.393
You can use e-mail and a webhook together.

00:01:30.084 --> 00:01:33.559
If your tool gives you a
secret, add it in the box below,

00:01:33.609 --> 00:01:36.491
so it can tell each message
came from Alaventra.

00:01:37.515 --> 00:01:41.615
Now click Send a test to check
that it arrives, then click Save.

00:01:41.665 --> 00:01:44.576
The line beside them says when
the next summary goes out.

00:01:46.011 --> 00:01:50.246
Finally, What went out lists every
report that was sent, and any held back,

00:01:50.296 --> 00:01:51.223
with the reason.

00:01:52.944 --> 00:01:57.138
Each row shows the report, the channel,
who it went to, and the result.

00:01:59.015 --> 00:02:03.765
Now your finished reports reach your team
where it already works, on your schedule,

00:02:03.815 --> 00:02:09.084
with nothing to send by hand. Only your
company's owner can change these settings.

00:02:10.082 --> 00:02:14.562
So, choose how often, pick e-mail
or a webhook, send a test and save,

00:02:14.612 --> 00:02:15.925
then check what went out.

00:02:17.057 --> 00:02:19.657
Your reports are on their way. Next,

00:02:19.707 --> 00:02:23.698
keep your company and websites
in order in tutorial 10.5.
